  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "菅芒"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">山尾溜、崙頭頂、溪溝邊kap荒埔，無發柴樹仔ê所在，lóng ē hōo一種號做菅芒ê草仔占--去，tsit種bái-suí仔bái-suí葉墘利利ē割--人ê菅尾草，m̄-nā臭賤niâ koh tsiânn ē擋得khó旱日曝，便若落塗隨釘根發葉，歹運tiâu tī石壁縫mā有才調生湠。對作穡人來講，伊是敗害種作koh tsiânn歹治ê雜草仔，大phō--起-來ê老欉，就準講kā剃頭剉kah光光光，仝款無啥礙--著，liam-mi發新芽--ah，tio̍h-ài kā規粒ê老頭thuánn起來倒píng，根盤現天（hiàn-thian）連suà曝兩、三工ê大日，hōo伊ê根póo--去，tsiah ē應效。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh，顧人怨ê雜草mā ke減有一好thang取。Tī清明ê前後，ē tuì根頭ê所在發幼幼ê新ínn出--來，tse就是菅尾筍，beh挽ài攑刀仔，人ànn低落去割，有淡薄仔費氣，peh殼--過ê新筍ē-sái落鼎炒肉絲，駛mé火用蒜頭khiàn芳，顛倒是一粒一ê料理，食--過ê人lóng呵咾kah ē tak舌。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大夠在ê菅芒tī白露hit跤兜，ē先吐一穗尖尖、紅紅親像毛筆尾ê花m̂出來見--人，thìng候總開--開，規沿紅gê紅gê ê海湧真正有夠suí；極ke是一禮拜hiah久，花ē結子變ta-ta，beh-lut仔beh-lut tiâu tī ue頂；風若khah透--leh，幼綿綿ê花穗ná搖ná落，tuè風iānn-iānn飛，lìng起去半天kuân，去所有ē-sái停跤、歇喘ê所在。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若有好心情，徛tī山邊斟酌看一絲一絲親像bông霧ê菅芒花leh飛，心肝就ē輕鬆爽快，bē輸雲尪án-ne tī半空中liam-mi徙東liam-mi徙西，若準ē-tàng án-ne浮tsiūnn浮落，mā是一種tsiânn暢ê代誌；m̄-koh，獨獨是我niâ，無半个人有tsit款心情徛tī hia沓沓仔看、khuann-khuann仔享受--過，kám講對四箍liàn-tńg樸實、臭賤ê花草看bē tsiūnn目，就無閒工去斟酌tsit款代誌，若án-ne來比phīng，真正就差天kap地--ah；是m̄是我khah tsa̍t頭，kan-na菅芒花就看kah gōng神--去lóng無越頭，iah是別人無夠巧，bē-hiáu tńg-se̍h、欣賞，我mā m̄知。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/QW3v6q\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/QW3v6q</a>）</span></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghXXRLgKj_kjRGhifVnrKVRjwL0KpLScEzwjSifUm_RJ59voh0N7PrTlyCpo5vJLSJhknS648lJrOGaxLs7XsOyqKWjPPUMz6J4RoRyjlA_GI73SPqoOLsq-Mz5wghm1nfibnvNRlFKTUQG8kiCafC1KBR6DrxX6N9smtThcVH7KH5UXDY6bG-BxO-fw/s1421/345%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghXXRLgKj_kjRGhifVnrKVRjwL0KpLScEzwjSifUm_RJ59voh0N7PrTlyCpo5vJLSJhknS648lJrOGaxLs7XsOyqKWjPPUMz6J4RoRyjlA_GI73SPqoOLsq-Mz5wghm1nfibnvNRlFKTUQG8kiCafC1KBR6DrxX6N9smtThcVH7KH5UXDY6bG-BxO-fw/w450-h640/345%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhRv2ZDF9oNwkudNHiTuTzqKvhIIYVXJnyyg1GWG0FOXG_1f5ZYBzm3pg5jbZj3veTPwyE8zdrFEUazk5yFr7HOJw61DyCCiKOk1paawo5-WvPzspzLttXnfbhc3OXJGs-9Va44i3_ZBnBnVkXbGfb030_lpJTFCv3bRdhXy1ONohHvVvObAlE9RiakXA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%817.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhRv2ZDF9oNwkudNHiTuTzqKvhIIYVXJnyyg1GWG0FOXG_1f5ZYBzm3pg5jbZj3veTPwyE8zdrFEUazk5yFr7HOJw61DyCCiKOk1paawo5-WvPzspzLttXnfbhc3OXJGs-9Va44i3_ZBnBnVkXbGfb030_lpJTFCv3bRdhXy1ONohHvVvObAlE9RiakXA/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%